<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>酷安话题-NAS</title><link>https://www.coolapk.com/</link><atom:link href="http://10.0.0.5:1200/coolapk/huati/NAS" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"></atom:link><description>酷安话题-NAS - Powered by RSSHub</description><generator>RSSHub</generator><webMaster>contact@rsshub.app (RSSHub)</webMaster><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 05:09:45 GMT</lastBuildDate><ttl>60</ttl><item><title>#Emby# #NAS# 查看链接 三天试用，三网直连，个人感觉更新快，速度也挺快！</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;feed-link-tag&quot; href=&quot;https://www.coolapk.com/t/Emby?type=0&quot;&gt;#Emby#&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;feed-link-tag&quot; href=&quot;https://www.coolapk.com/t/NAS?type=0&quot;&gt;#NAS#&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;feed-link-url&quot; href=&quot;https://t.me/etflix_emby_bot?start=etflixref_69XLMWHFXZSJ&quot; title=&quot;https://t.me/etflix_emby_bot?start=etflixref_69XLMWHFXZSJ&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;查看链接&lt;/a&gt;       三天试用，三网直连，个人感觉更新快，速度也挺快！&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://10.0.0.1:50108/coolapk_img/f2eb57634e87a80c8ac3af2d53677e47.jpg&quot; &gt;</description><link>https://www.coolapk.com/feed/74392452</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.coolapk.com/feed/74392452</guid><pubDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 03:11:05 GMT</pubDate><author>豆你玩_</author></item><item><title>#NAS# 老哥们用的都是什么盘啊，有没有推荐的，性价比高一点的啊</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;feed-link-tag&quot; href=&quot;https://www.coolapk.com/t/NAS?type=0&quot;&gt;#NAS#&lt;/a&gt; 老哥们用的都是什么盘啊，有没有推荐的，性价比高一点的啊&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://www.coolapk.com/feed/74390630</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.coolapk.com/feed/74390630</guid><pubDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 01:48:00 GMT</pubDate><author>Ssudaa</author></item><item><title>查看链接 最简单的无服务器部署openlist教程[受虐滑稽]（小白自己弄的，不知道有没有哪里不对[受虐滑稽]） （其实是openlist-worker啦），感觉已经勉强可以用了...</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a cla